---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import Fixture from "../../components/Fixture.astro";
---
<Base title="Form" description="iVOLT form controls: labels, inputs, textarea, native select, checkboxes, radios, help and error text, fieldsets. Native controls, CSS only.">
  <article class="docs-prose">
    <h1>Form</h1>
    <p>Native controls styled with tokens. Every control needs a visible <code>&lt;label&gt;</code>; help and error text are linked with <code>aria-describedby</code>. No JavaScript, no custom widgets.</p>
    <p><strong>CSS:</strong> included in <code>ivolt.css</code>; standalone <code>css/components/form.css</code>.</p>
    <Fixture name="form/basic" />
    <h2>Error and disabled</h2>
    <p>Mark invalid fields with <code>aria-invalid="true"</code> and point <code>aria-describedby</code> at the <code>iv-field__error</code> element. Disabled controls use the native attribute.</p>
    <Fixture name="form/error" />
    <h2>Classes</h2>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Class</th><th>Element</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>iv-field</code></td><td>Wrapper: label, control, help/error stacked.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>iv-label</code>, <code>iv-label__required</code></td><td><code>&lt;label&gt;</code> and the required marker (keep <code>required</code> on the control).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>iv-input</code></td><td><code>&lt;input&gt;</code> (text-like types) and <code>&lt;textarea&gt;</code>.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>iv-select</code></td><td>Native <code>&lt;select&gt;</code>.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>iv-check</code>, <code>iv-checks</code>, <code>iv-checks--inline</code></td><td>Label wrapping a checkbox or radio; vertical or inline groups.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>iv-fieldset</code>, <code>iv-fieldset__legend</code></td><td>Grouping with a legend.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>iv-field__help</code>, <code>iv-field__error</code></td><td>Help and error text.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <h2>Common mistakes</h2>
    <ul><li>Placeholder used as the only label.</li><li>Error text not referenced by <code>aria-describedby</code>.</li><li>Demo forms that post to a backend that does not exist: say it is a demo, as the examples above do.</li></ul>
  </article>
</Base>
